# Paths and words that are not credentials, for this repository.
#
# This file is committed. `.gesta/secret-allowlist` is the local one and is ignored with the rest of
# the repository state, so a fresh clone would otherwise have no allowlist and its own fixtures would
# read as credentials.
#
# A scanner that refuses the project's own test suite is a scanner nobody keeps, and a project that
# switches the scanner off to commit its tests has no scanner at all. Every entry below covers a
# fixture in this tree and nothing else.

# The PEM header in the tls tests is a string the parser is asked to reject.
path src/transport/tls.rs

# The S3 tests build a signature from the example key in the provider's documentation.
path src/transport/s3.rs
path src/transport/sigv4.rs

# The scanner's own tests carry one of every shape it has to recognise. A scanner that cannot ship
# the examples it is tested against is a scanner nobody can review.
path src/support/leak.rs
path src/support/secrets.rs

# Documentation and benchmarks quote shapes on purpose.
path docs/**
path bench/**
